    {
      "uid": "zhcn:448670778b6a8851c83cb84d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──二月。春天近在咫尺，\n对即将挑战经典赛战线的荒漠英雄来说\n现在正是起跑的前一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793761a34f2ea85b3bbad22983c316e46677bc63eb304e546fbfe116fc48a001",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
