    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d428c1dd4e13a3b11cab752",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然决定走上王道，自然就得经历经典三冠，\n而我也针对此目标排定了至今所有训练。\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb9857dbdc1022295782b875e3fdb89a71577cb637115127a2d34c89e7a0028",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
