      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……“皋月赏”。\n我真的有机会获胜吗？\n追根究底，我真的有办法参赛吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2fba405b8f277831c3d88a441e149cf408e0dfaaa95f1fed8e130d35fca8854",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
