      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我……我也努力思索了一阵子，\n最后终于想到一个心愿……\n我想让你知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2d45286b24d4f1b66e9510e9b61610ce8dbf82358814d50ac793e1e48dcd30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
