    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e230be8778cf244d4e2db83c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小时候……\n我曾经看过真正的英雄。\n虽然是在电视上看到的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20d627a9813f3f669ab00cf975b49debde5b935e23ca691783b4db702a051dde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a425d59ef17318222cdf1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0ae7816c9b67fd2ff525e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一位赛马娘威风凛凛地站在屏幕中央……\n接受绵延不绝的欢呼声与所有人的称赞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84690e2ceb2a01e30dd7a8c16515ba26a8cbc51179c3d135dfd614e067903497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f11b453a699e6a725558be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056e055a39e25aec3e005c14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "定睛一看，原来那个节目正在访问\n在“日本德比”创下英雄事迹的选手。\n说起来不过就是常见的体育竞赛转播节目──",
      "source_fingerprint": "105107c4ee30525be3c934cdd45db8749a64528cf89b3cee1e4dc282d2607245",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b44811717e068836c82b79e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天就到此为止吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a2e4b8e7afe04f30ee9769d28e1f185029ee083f5c0cfb51f2daa0a766a292",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b60a57d334a64a455a093ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7674326991a0d7312fbb8d48d0178fd3c8a9c3e9aa4f16fad4fb0056487d3db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7589a17f0a7ed4125e433986",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42420b69b0da9969752aea84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看在当时的我眼里，那简直就像\n一篇精彩的故事……完全不输书中那些\n打倒龙的王者，或征服过七大洋的海贼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc8fc86e43404def2e3de06a72341d7f9d73e707697dc21ab4cfb682dc26d76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597b56c8620e74a4e7b63b49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
