      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc0e4835ff24f471df56a7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "德比这场比赛本身就是一篇精彩故事……\n所以我深深认为那次访问正是一本英雄传说。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "881a1445d2cc8caad5be2154548d04466e9bf0a9a1b15bae2bfee2b6e963046e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d01b0ec596b3a5d13fb167c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be79062fbf570d0277caa2ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时我才发现原来现实中真的有英雄。\n原来英雄不只存在于故事之中。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "235ec8be20cc88e825beee47e8671d0c553db10614145805a00fb884afb8af68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d7c3188c54fad233d48ba9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9731a306644cb7f87e21e0b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……所以，既然想成为英雄，\n我的故事中就绝不能缺少“日本德比”这个篇章。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba4ff8889e9530e080eedad4c3461f0a9e47a81daf8972d906b09ed401714656",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
